body.p:
Without conceding that these rejections are proper, Applicant has amended independent claims 1 and 19 based on the allowable subject matter. Features of allowable claim 34 have been incorporated into each of amended independent claims 1 and 19. Accordingly, Applicant submits that each of claims 1 and 19 are in condition for allowance, and Applicant respectfullyrequests withdrawal of the rejections. The rest of the rejected claims depend from one of thes SVG
